# ADR-0026 Decision 4: land play and mana abilities are priority answers.
# In the driven Main1, human plays Mountain (CR 305.1, keeps priority, CR
# 116.3), taps it for R (CR 605.3a, no stack, keeps priority) and casts
# Lightning Bolt at ai. Both pass; Bolt resolves.
startturn human
# Upkeep and Draw first: a queued action is spent on the first priority
# round that asks its player, so queue only once Main1 is next.
step 2
queue targets ai
queue action human playland 1
queue action human tapformana 1 R
queue action human cast 2
step
